{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113225","id":3050313755,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc610Bgb","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113225","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113225.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/113225.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113225","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113225/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/113225/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/113225/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/a67c1df697d92e3ed3a5c61a8832a9d130ee16b8","number":113225,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Windows: Make GPU preference symbols configurable at build time","user":{"login":"LanzaSchneider","id":24624901,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI0NjI0OTAx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24624901?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider","html_url":"https://github.com/LanzaSchneider","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/LanzaSchneider/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Currently, Godot always exports `NvOptimusEnablement` and `AmdPowerXpressRequestHighPerformance` symbols on Windows, forcing the use of  discrete GPU on hybrid graphics systems when using OpenGL/GLES.\r\n\r\nThis change adds a build-time option to disable these symbols, allowing applications to respect OS and driver settings instead. This is useful for:\r\n- Laptop users wanting to save battery\r\n- Non-game applications (desktop pets, tools, etc.)\r\n- Projects that don't require high GPU performance\r\n\r\nThe default behavior is unchanged (`prefer_high_performance_gpu=yes`), preserving backward compatibility.\r\n\r\nUsage:\r\n```bash\r\n# Respect system GPU preferences (disable the hardcoded symbols)\r\nscons platform=windows prefer_high_performance_gpu=no\r\n\r\n# Default behavior (equivalent to current hardcoded behavior)\r\nscons platform=windows prefer_high_performance_gpu=yes\r\n```\r\n\r\nNote: Vulkan backend already supports runtime GPU selection via command-line arguments and is not affected by this change.","labels":[{"id":73330066,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2Ng==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/enhancement","name":"enhancement","description":"","color":"aaccff","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":205417413,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyMDU0MTc0MTM=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/platform:windows","name":"platform:windows","description":"","color":"e4e4e4","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098009,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgwMDk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:buildsystem","name":"topic:buildsystem","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098255,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyNTU=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:platforms","name":"topic:platforms","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at"